OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon suspended over
OL,4,A'objectively antisemitic' posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior surgeon has been suspended
OL,7,Fover what were described at a tribunal
OL,8,Fas "objectively antisemitic" social
OL,9,Fmedia posts.
OL,11,FMuhammad Khalil posted "Death to
OL,12,FIsrael" across an image of the Star of
OL,13,FDavid on Instagram in 2023 following
OL,14,Fthe attacks on Israel by Hamas on 7
OL,15,FOctober that year, which killed about
OL,16,F1,200 people.
OL,18,FUK Lawyers for Israel (UKLI)
OL,19,Fcomplained, arguing that his social
OL,20,Fmedia posts had brought his profession
OL,21,Finto disrepute and that Jewish patients
OL,22,Fwould not feel safe in his care.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
