OL,5,
OL,6,FA Medical Practitioners Tribunal
OL,7,FService (MPTS) panel also found the
OL,8,Fposts to have fallen outside legitimate
OL,9,Fdebate and/or criticism of Israel, and
OL,10,Fsupportive of violence.
